                                                "sense_id": "ceeffd5d-0318-3803-9495-bf8186c56f44",
                                                "text": "Eight days after Kamala Harris announced Tim Walz as her running mate, the Criticism section on Walz’s Wikipedia article was removed in its entirety. (The removal was made by an editor with administrator status who is in the top 100 list of editors by number of edits.)"
